# Canonicalize author/committer identities for git shortlog/log/blame and GitHub.
# Non-destructive: this only changes how names/emails are DISPLAYED; it does not
# rewrite any commits. Format: `Canonical Name <canonical@email> <commit@email>`.
# See `git help mailmap`.

